<title>HONG KONG: Ford unit Ford Motor Credit to price FRN.</title>
<headline>Ford unit Ford Motor Credit to price FRN.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ford Motor Credit will price a US$750 million Euro-Asian floating rate note in early London hours on Monday, joint lead manager and bookrunner Lehman Brothers said.</p>
<p>The notes are due January 2002 and will be priced to yield 16-17 basis points over the three-month London Interbank Offered Rate.</p>
<p>The notes will be listed in Hong Kong, Singapore and Luxembourg. Settlement is January 17.</p>
<p>The notes are rated A1 by Moody's Investors Service and A-plus by Standard and Poor's Corp.</p>
<p>Merrill Lynch is the other joint lead manager.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843-6371</p>
